#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setup instructions for using IBM Quantum on IBM Cloud to submit Qiskit SDK and Qiskit Runtime jobs by using the REST API"
msgstr "Einrichtungsanweisungen zur Verwendung von IBM Quantum auf IBM Cloud zum Einreichen von Qiskit SDK- und Qiskit Runtime-Jobs über die REST-API"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up to use IBM Quantum Platform with REST API"
msgstr "Einrichtung zur Verwendung von IBM Quantum Platform mit REST-API"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore urlendcoded, WQVY */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore urlendcoded, WQVY */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up to use IBM Quantum Platform with REST API {#set-up-to-use-ibm-quantum-platform-with-rest-api}"
msgstr "Einrichtung zur Verwendung von IBM Quantum Platform mit REST-API {#set-up-to-use-ibm-quantum-platform-with-rest-api}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can access quantum processors with REST APIs, enabling you to work with QPUs using any programming language or framework.\n"
msgstr "Du kannst auf Quantenprozessoren mit REST-APIs zugreifen, sodass du mit QPUs in jeder Programmiersprache oder jedem Framework arbeiten kannst.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Get access {#1-get-access}"
msgstr "1. Zugang erhalten {#1-get-access}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you do not already have a user account, get one at the [IBM Quantum login page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/login).\n"
msgstr "Falls du noch kein Benutzerkonto hast, erstelle eines auf der [IBM Quantum-Anmeldeseite](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/login).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an API key (also called a token) on the [dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com). Note that the same API key can be used for either region.\n"
msgstr "Erstelle einen API-Schlüssel (auch Token genannt) auf dem [Dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com). Beachte, dass derselbe API-Schlüssel für beide Regionen verwendet werden kann.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"1. Generate an IBM Cloud Identity and Access Management (IAM) bearer token. This is a short-lived token  used to authenticate requests to the REST API. To generate one, call the [IAM Identity Services API](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/iam-identity-token-api#create-api-key) as shown in the following sample request:\n"
"<Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"1. Generiere ein IBM Cloud Identity and Access Management (IAM) Bearer-Token. Dies ist ein kurzlebiges Token, das zur Authentifizierung von Anfragen an die REST-API verwendet wird. Um eines zu generieren, rufe die [IAM Identity Services API](https://cloud.ibm.com/apidocs/iam-identity-token-api#create-api-key) auf, wie in der folgenden Beispielanfrage gezeigt:\n"
"<Tabs>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   <TabItem value=\"Curl\" label=\"Curl\">\n"
msgstr "   <TabItem value=\"Curl\" label=\"Curl\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   Expected Response\n"
msgstr "   Erwartete Antwort\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   </TabItem>\n"
msgstr "   </TabItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "   <TabItem value=\"Python\" label=\"Python\">\n"
msgstr "   <TabItem value=\"Python\" label=\"Python\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"   </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Choose an authentication method {#2-choose-an-authentication-method}"
msgstr "2. Wähle eine Authentifizierungsmethode {#2-choose-an-authentication-method}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose the appropriate authentication method, depending on your working environment:\n"
msgstr "Wähle die geeignete Authentifizierungsmethode, abhängig von deiner Arbeitsumgebung:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Create an environment variable for your API key (trusted Python environments)](#environment_variable)\n"
msgstr "[Erstelle eine Umgebungsvariable für deinen API-Schlüssel (vertrauenswürdige Python-Umgebungen)](#environment_variable)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Use your API key directly (untrusted environment)](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted#rest-untrusted)\n"
msgstr "[Verwende deinen API-Schlüssel direkt (nicht vertrauenswürdige Umgebung)](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted#rest-untrusted)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"environment_variable\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"environment_variable\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an environment variable (trusted environment) {#create-an-environment-variable-trusted-environment}"
msgstr "Erstelle eine Umgebungsvariable (vertrauenswürdige Umgebung) {#create-an-environment-variable-trusted-environment}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "To set the IQP_API_TOKEN environment variable in your system, you can add the following line to your shell profile (for example, .bashrc or .zshrc) or by setting it directly in your terminal:\n"
msgstr "Um die IQP_API_TOKEN-Umgebungsvariable in deinem System festzulegen, kannst du die folgende Zeile zu deinem Shell-Profil hinzufügen (z.B. .bashrc oder .zshrc) oder sie direkt in deinem Terminal setzen:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```shell\n"
"    export IQP_API_TOKEN=<your-API_KEY> \n"
"    # Use the 44-character API_KEY you created and saved \n"
"    # from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard\n"
"    ```\n"
"    When you invoke the environment variable in your code, include `import os`, as in this example:\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```shell\n"
"    export IQP_API_TOKEN=<your-API_KEY> \n"
"    # Use the 44-character API_KEY you created and saved \n"
"    # from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard\n"
"    ```\n"
"    Wenn du die Umgebungsvariable in deinem Code aufrufst, füge `import os` hinzu, wie in diesem Beispiel:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    import os\n"
"    api_token = os.environ['IQP_API_TOKEN']\n"
"    ```\n"
"    Note that when creating an environment variable, your API key is still stored locally in plain text, and should be safeguarded.\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    import os\n"
"    api_token = os.environ['IQP_API_TOKEN']\n"
"    ```\n"
"    Beachte, dass beim Erstellen einer Umgebungsvariablen dein API-Schlüssel immer noch lokal im Klartext gespeichert ist und geschützt werden sollte.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authenticate requests to the Qiskit Runtime REST API by including the CRN and bearer token to the request's headers.\n"
msgstr "Authentifiziere Anfragen an die Qiskit Runtime REST-API, indem du den CRN und das Bearer-Token in die Request-Header aufnimmst.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Optional: Configure your firewall {#3-optional-configure-your-firewall}"
msgstr "3. Optional: Konfiguriere deine Firewall {#3-optional-configure-your-firewall}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    If necessary, use [this information](/guides/quickstart-steps-org#firewall) to enable access to the IBM Quantum API endpoints.\n"
msgstr "    Falls erforderlich, verwende [diese Informationen](/guides/quickstart-steps-org#firewall), um den Zugriff auf die IBM Quantum-API-Endpunkte zu ermöglichen.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Nächste Schritte {#next-steps}"

